[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0543","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0543.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54490","title":"Faye websocket-driver 消息压缩资源限制绕过漏洞","description":"websocket-driver 库在配合 permessage-deflate 扩展使用时存在资源限制绕过漏洞。该漏洞源于消息大小检查逻辑缺陷：库在 lib/websocket/driver/hybi.js 中仅根据压缩后的帧长度头校验消息大小，而非解压后的实际大小。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送特制的压缩 WebSocket 消息，使服务端或客户端接受远超配置上限的消息，导致目标系统内存和 CPU 资源被过度消耗，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用 websocket-driver 0.7.5 之前版本且启用了 permessage-deflate 扩展的应用，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54490","GHSA-mp7j-qc5w-4988"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-23T18:14:09Z","remediation":"立即将 websocket-driver 升级至 0.7.5 或以上版本（npm update websocket-driver），该版本在解压后校验消息长度以修复压缩绕过问题。如无法升级，可禁用 permessage-deflate 扩展（设置 perMessageDeflate: false）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/faye/websocket-driver-node/commit/c55679a5b18251dd0a55d18a0cc6a4fd8822b92f","https://github.com/faye/websocket-driver-node/security/advisories/GHSA-mp7j-qc5w-4988","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54490.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54490.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/npm/websocket-driver/CVE-2026-54490.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-54490","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54490.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-54490.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54490.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54490.json","https://github.com/av1155/houndarr/blob/2297479825b119067d15a7517305fd3522a4a84e/website/pnpm-workspace.yaml","https://github.com/JimBLogic/CyberDailyLog/blob/98e56ea25f36fdfe6e855955b7a08d4f4ed26469/reports/archive/2026/07/2026-07-18.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0543.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0540","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0540.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54466","title":"Faye websocket-driver 协议长度头解析整数溢出导致消息损坏漏洞","description":"websocket-driver 是一个可插拔 I/O 的 WebSocket 协议处理器，其 draft 版本协议帧格式中的长度头字段允许将任意大的整数编码为高位设置为 1 的字节序列。攻击者可通过发送包含无限个 0x80 及以上字节值的消息，使服务器在 lib/websocket/driver/draft75.js 中将这些字节解析为不断增长的整数。由于 JavaScript 使用 64 位浮点数表示数值，该整数最终会超出精确表示范围导致精度丢失，进而使后续载荷被错误解析，造成消息损坏。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发此漏洞，影响所有使用 websocket-driver 0.7.5 之前版本的应用。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.2，危害等级严重，建议立即升级至 0.7.5 版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54466","GHSA-xv26-6w52-cph6"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-23T16:18:40Z","remediation":"立即将 websocket-driver 升级至 0.7.5 或更高版本。该版本已通过拒绝超过最大消息长度的长度头来修复此漏洞。由于无已知临时缓解措施，升级是唯一有效的修复方案。对于使用 npm 的项目，执行 `npm install websocket-driver@0.7.5`；对于直接引用的项目，从 https://github.com/faye/websocket-driver-node 获取最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/faye/websocket-driver-node/commit/5b197ca874dab58e96cacad8a3c256797d804680","https://github.com/faye/websocket-driver-node/security/advisories/GHSA-xv26-6w52-cph6","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54466.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54466.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/npm/websocket-driver/CVE-2026-54466.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-54466","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54466.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54466.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-54466.md","https://github.com/oxsecurity/megalinter/blob/b692e4ecc72cf5c2640f684495cee7ac50c38fda/.trivyignore","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/d37b6124deba683a2715dadc3684feb1bae7bc91/cve/CVE-2026-54466.html","https://github.com/archestra-ai/archestra/blob/ad1dbe023ba9a94eb4afe90bee2d8a8f0b357911/platform/pnpm-workspace.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0540.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0493","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0493.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54163","title":"GitHub secure_headers Content-Security-Policy 指令注入漏洞","description":"secure_headers Ruby 库在构建 Content-Security-Policy 响应头时，将各指令通过 `; ` 拼接，但 `build_sandbox_list_directive`、`build_media_type_list_directive` 和 `build_report_to_directive` 三个构建器未对用户输入中的 `;`、`\\r`、`\\n` 进行过滤。当应用程序将不可信输入传递给 `override_content_security_policy_directives` 或 `append_content_security_policy_directives` 的 `:sandbox`、`:plugin_types` 或 `:report_to` 参数时，攻击者可注入 `script-src 'unsafe-inline' *` 等恶意 CSP 指令。由于 CSP 解析器遵循首次出现规则，注入的 `script-src` 会覆盖应用配置的严格策略，导致内联脚本可被执行，造成跨站脚本攻击（XSS）。此外，攻击者还可通过注入 `report-uri` 将 CSP 违规报告重定向到攻击者服务器，窃取包含 URL、源码位置等敏感信息的报告。该漏洞影响 secure_headers ≤7.2.0 版本，7.3.0 版本已修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54163","GHSA-rqq5-2gf9-4w4q"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-23T18:04:31Z","remediation":"立即将 `secure_headers` gem 升级至 7.3.0 或以上版本（`bundle update secure_headers`）。如无法立即升级，对所有传入 `SecureHeaders.override_content_security_policy_directives`、`append_content_security_policy_directives` 及 `use_content_security_policy_named_append` 中 `:sandbox`、`:plugin_types`、`:report_to` 三个参数的输入值，在传入前过滤掉 `;`、`\\r`、`\\n` 字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/github/secure_headers/commit/286a79dea80c6a9be4ca93e0f284c923cf77e539","https://github.com/github/secure_headers/releases/tag/v7.3.0","https://github.com/github/secure_headers/security/advisories/GHSA-rqq5-2gf9-4w4q","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/6abafa39bbf76fbd32a01a93a3a2ba048c0f7143/gems/secure_headers/CVE-2026-54163.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54163.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54163.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54163.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-54163","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/7fe93c0d9f67491f32ca61e33aaca423a4c19903/advisories/_posts/2026-06-03-CVE-2026-54163.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54163.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-54163.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/gem/secure_headers/CVE-2026-54163.yml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-rqq5-2gf9-4w4q/GHSA-rqq5-2gf9-4w4q.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0493.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0491","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0491.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54159","title":"PrestaShop ps_facetedsearch PHP对象注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"PrestaShop 的 ps_facetedsearch 分层导航筛选模块存在 PHP 对象注入漏洞。该模块从请求 URL 中重建筛选条件时，未对滑块筛选器（价格或重量）参数值进行充分校验，直接将其序列化后存入内部缓存，随后使用原生 `unserialize()` 反序列化读取。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的恶意序列化 PHP 对象注入缓存，触发 gadget 链在模块目录下写入任意 PHP 文件作为 webshell，进而实现远程代码执行，完全控制服务器。该漏洞影响 ps_facetedsearch 3.0.0 至 4.0.3 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。官方已在 4.0.4 版本中修复，建议立即升级或替换 `Block.php` 中 `unserialize()` 为 `Tools::unSerialize()`。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54159","GHSA-m5f5-28qr-9g9r"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:07Z","updated":"2026-07-23T16:04:11Z","remediation":"立即将 ps_facetedsearch 模块升级到 4.0.4 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，手动修改 src/Filters/Block.php 中 getFromCache() 方法，将 unserialize() 替换为 \\Tools::unSerialize()；同时移除前台筛选模板中的价格和重量滑块筛选器，清除 faceted-search 过滤器缓存，并在 WAF 层面拦截包含 PHP 序列化特征（如 O:、;i:）的搜索请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/PrestaShop/ps_facetedsearch/commit/9ca839fac68a60641d8187a3ff9730ab09af33cb","https://github.com/PrestaShop/ps_facetedsearch/releases/tag/v4.0.4","https://github.com/PrestaShop/ps_facetedsearch/security/advisories/GHSA-m5f5-28qr-9g9r","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54159.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54159.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54159.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2026/CVE-2026-54159/README.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/packagist/prestashop/ps_facetedsearch/CVE-2026-54159.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-54159.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/289454b1705420b325f7615708efca878371bd29/cve/CVE-2026-54159.html","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/0262d64737c11a639346262c413e84b552ac0aa6/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-54159-prestashop-ps-facetedsearch-php-object-injection-in-faceted-search-cache-allows-unauthenticated-rce.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54159.json","https://github.com/Unclecheng-li/cybersecurity-daily/blob/de7a9bfa47d70d2c0b8019d75a894c095cc61df8/daily/2026-07-11.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0491.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0491.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0442","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0442.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53727","title":"Ruby css_parser 服务器端请求伪造与本地文件读取漏洞","description":"Ruby CSS 解析库 css_parser 在 2.2.0 至 3.0.0 版本中存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）与本地文件读取漏洞。`CssParser::Parser#read_remote_file` 方法在处理远程 CSS 文件时未对目标主机、IP 地址及 URI 协议进行任何校验，允许攻击者通过 `@import url(...)` 注入任意 HTTP/HTTPS 请求，可访问内网服务、云元数据接口等受限资源。更严重的是，该方法会递归跟随 HTTP 重定向且不检查目标协议，攻击者可构造 `Location: file:///etc/passwd` 将 SSRF 升级为任意本地文件读取。任何将攻击者可控 CSS 与 `base_uri:` 选项传入 css_parser 的应用（如 Premailer 邮件处理管道）均受影响。官方已在 3.0.0 版本中通过引入 ssrf_filter 库、移除 file:// 远程读取路径等方式修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53727","GHSA-9pmc-p236-855h"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:07Z","updated":"2026-07-23T16:15:11Z","remediation":"立即将 css_parser 升级至 3.0.0 或更高版本，该版本默认通过 ssrf_filter 拒绝内网地址和 file:// 协议。如无法升级，在调用 Parser.new 时不要传入用户可控的 base_uri 参数，并对所有 @import url() 中的 URL 进行白名单校验，仅允许 http/https 协议且过滤内网 IP 段。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/premailer/css_parser/commit/7d2ddf0189cd54b54f378f59daefa10cb036e476","https://github.com/premailer/css_parser/commit/e0a151458b2a801ae265ba420862ef8b1127b3ae","https://github.com/premailer/css_parser/releases/tag/v3.0.0","https://github.com/premailer/css_parser/security/advisories/GHSA-9pmc-p236-855h","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/6abafa39bbf76fbd32a01a93a3a2ba048c0f7143/gems/css_parser/CVE-2026-53727.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53727.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-53727.md","https://github.com/errbit/errbit/blob/d172d02be24bd5462c8fcbd90baeb6e4ae5ed155/docs/relnotes/v0.10.12.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/1994996b0b1043aeb0b2d4db6d06b7a742460e16/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-53727.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-53727","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/7fe93c0d9f67491f32ca61e33aaca423a4c19903/advisories/_posts/2026-06-01-CVE-2026-53727.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53727.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/869f3abc79bfeaf3a31640839c1759509ebcc74c/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-53727/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-53727.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0442.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0442.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0349","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0349.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50274","title":"Datadog dd-trace-go W3C Baggage 标头解析拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Datadog dd-trace-go Go 客户端库在解析 W3C  baggage 传播头时存在资源分配无限制漏洞。该库在提取（extract）路径上未对 baggage HTTP 头的条目数量（默认上限 64）和总字节数（默认上限 8192）进行限制，仅对注入（inject）路径实施了检查。远程未认证攻击者可向目标服务发送包含任意大量逗号分隔键值对或单个超大值的 baggage 头，导致服务端为每个键值对分配哈希表条目，造成 CPU 和内存资源耗尽，引发拒绝服务。启用 baggage 传播风格的 HTTP 服务均受影响，该风格在大多数受影响追踪器中默认开启。DataDog 已在 dd-trace-go 2.8.1 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50274","GHSA-74j5-xf3v-crq8"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:07Z","updated":"2026-07-20T16:17:04Z","remediation":"立即将 dd-trace-go 升级至 2.8.1 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，从 DD_TRACE_PROPAGATION_STYLE 中移除 baggage（或设置 DD_TRACE_PROPAGATION_STYLE_EXTRACT 排除 baggage），并在反向代理层限制 HTTP 请求头大小（如 Nginx 设置 large_client_header_buffers 4 8k，Envoy 设置 max_request_headers_kb）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-go/commit/192712ba0291b2e89166259111ebb5e90c8f52df","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-go/pull/4720","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-go/releases/tag/v2.8.1","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-go/security/advisories/GHSA-74j5-xf3v-crq8","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50274.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_2_CVE-2026-50274.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-go/CVE-2026-50274.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-50274.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50274.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-50274.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/927c9425d8f7f6609247b04933b3bb339d0de5f8/posts/cve-2026-50274-go-github-com-datadog-dd-trace-go.html","https://github.com/abhishekaryan23/onived-blog/blob/e11db14729a4e8982e7232bbe0cd7eb89bc207f6/site/src/content/cve/cve-2026-50274.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2026-50274.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/a6bf5ac7a2ca0e41f63a084ce77e4e18a9b97446/CVEs_log/2026-07-18_zh.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0349.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0349.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0349.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0347","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0347.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50272","title":"DataDog dd-trace-js W3C Baggage 标头解析不当导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"dd-trace-js（Datadog APM Node.js 客户端）在解析 W3C baggage 传播头时未对提取路径实施条目数（默认 64）和字节大小（默认 8192）限制。远程未认证攻击者可发送包含大量逗号分隔键值对或单个超大值的 baggage 请求头，导致服务端为每个请求分配哈希表条目，造成 CPU 和内存资源无限消耗，从而引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有启用 baggage 传播的 HTTP 服务，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 5.100.0 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50272","GHSA-wxqq-gcq8-c443"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:07Z","updated":"2026-07-21T04:16:50Z","remediation":"升级 dd-trace-js 至 5.100.0 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，从 DD_TRACE_PROPAGATION_STYLE 中移除 baggage 以禁用其提取，或在反向代理层限制 HTTP 请求头大小（如 Nginx 设置 large_client_header_buffers、Apache 设置 LimitRequestFieldSize、Envoy 设置 max_request_headers_kb）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-js/commit/a7d4c0da05f67cde05a99272b725a317c461d0e6","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-js/pull/8255","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-js/releases/tag/v5.100.0","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-js/security/advisories/GHSA-wxqq-gcq8-c443","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50272.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/dd-trace/CVE-2026-50272.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50272.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_3_CVE-2026-50272.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-50272.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/93d5167c4976c9015270e856ca23ec6140d458aa/posts/cve-2026-50272-npm-dd-trace.html","https://github.com/danielfebrero/Fresh0day-PoCs/blob/ed049b0f8549b25b92b26174db3899b34db0b04f/CVE-2026-50272/README.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-wxqq-gcq8-c443/GHSA-wxqq-gcq8-c443.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-50272.json","https://github.com/abhishekaryan23/onived-blog/blob/e11db14729a4e8982e7232bbe0cd7eb89bc207f6/site/src/content/cve/cve-2026-50272.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0347.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0347.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0347.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0346","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0346.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50271","title":"Datadog dd-trace-py W3C Baggage 头解析拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Datadog dd-trace-py（Python APM 客户端）在解析 W3C Baggage HTTP 头时存在资源分配不当漏洞。该库在提取（extract）路径上未对 Baggage 头的条目数量（默认上限 64）和总字节数（默认上限 8192）进行限制，而仅对注入（injection）路径施加了限制。远程未认证攻击者可向目标服务发送包含大量逗号分隔键值对或单个超大值的 Baggage 头，导致 tracer 为每个键值对分配哈希表条目，从而消耗无限制的 CPU 和内存资源，造成拒绝服务。该 Baggage 传播风格在多数受影响版本中默认启用，任何使用受影响 dd-trace-py 版本且暴露于互联网的 HTTP 服务均受影响。已在 dd-trace-py 4.8.2 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50271","GHSA-mw54-j2v2-42hr"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:07Z","updated":"2026-07-20T20:16:44Z","remediation":"立即将 dd-trace-py 升级至 4.8.2 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，从 DD_TRACE_PROPAGATION_STYLE 中移除 baggage 以禁用 baggage 提取；同时在上游代理或 Web 服务器（如 Nginx large_client_header_buffers、Apache LimitRequestFieldSize）限制 HTTP 请求头最大大小作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-py/commit/9c80faa3dcfe238d008c3b3cd0b8e5dfef0aa4cd","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-py/pull/17926","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-py/releases/tag/v4.8.2","https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-py/security/advisories/GHSA-mw54-j2v2-42hr","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50271.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/ddtrace/CVE-2026-50271.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50271.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_2_CVE-2026-50271.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-50271.md","https://github.com/scaleapi/scale-agentex/blob/2c4f061569a4249d47b27233f01c3aa9054341fe/agentex/pyproject.toml","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/93d5167c4976c9015270e856ca23ec6140d458aa/posts/cve-2026-50271-pip-ddtrace.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-mw54-j2v2-42hr/GHSA-mw54-j2v2-42hr.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-50271.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/a6bf5ac7a2ca0e41f63a084ce77e4e18a9b97446/CVEs_log/2026-07-18_zh.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0346.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0331","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0331.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49977","title":"AmauriC tarteaucitron.js Cookie 任意删除漏洞","description":"tarteaucitron.js 是一款合规的 Cookie 横幅管理工具，其 `tarteaucitron.cookie.purge()` 方法在调用时未校验触发元素是否为合法的 tarteaucitron 按钮，也未校验待删除的 Cookie 是否属于该工具管理的服务。攻击者若能在页面中注入 HTML，可通过构造带有 `purgeBtn` 类名和 `data-cookie` 属性的元素，诱骗用户点击后静默删除任意非 HttpOnly 的已知名称 Cookie。该漏洞影响 1.33.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。建议升级至 1.33.0 或更高版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49977","GHSA-jxj7-g6gm-49j7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:06Z","updated":"2026-07-20T19:17:24Z","remediation":"立即将 tarteaucitron.js 升级至 v1.33.0 或更高版本，该版本已对 purgeBtn 类元素的 data-cookie 属性进行合法性校验。如无法立即升级，可在服务端设置 Content-Security-Policy 限制 HTML 注入，并对所有敏感 Cookie 启用 HttpOnly 标志以防止被删除。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/AmauriC/tarteaucitron.js/commit/24b5464400ae2ff1ad96a092c629b9d632b9cc93","https://github.com/AmauriC/tarteaucitron.js/releases/tag/v1.33.0","https://github.com/AmauriC/tarteaucitron.js/security/advisories/GHSA-jxj7-g6gm-49j7","https://www.drupal.org/sa-contrib-2026-040","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49977.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-49977.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/tarteaucitronjs/CVE-2026-49977.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49977.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/26fa6fb4c5bf093f7e54213d60f33d0f834a139c/content/posts/cve-2026-49977.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/26a5e326ef676363d5474a63ced6954307af1dac/references/contrib1-CVE-2026-49977-2026-06-03-1705","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-jxj7-g6gm-49j7/GHSA-jxj7-g6gm-49j7.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-49977.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CVE-2026-49977-2026-06-03-1705","https://github.com/Huangu0/sec_rss_news/blob/39135d30f22c26acca3e969387228d89b339f0d6/output/daily/2026-07-18.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0331.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0331.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0271","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0271.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44891","title":"Netty StompSubframeDecoder 未限制请求头数量拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Netty 框架中的 STOMP 协议解码器 StompSubframeDecoder 存在未限制请求头数量和大小的漏洞。maxLineLength 参数仅限制单行头部长度，但未对单个 STOMP 帧中的总头部数量或累积大小进行限制。远程攻击者可发送大量短头部数据，导致服务端内存无限增长直至 JVM 抛出 OutOfMemoryError，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Netty 4.1.136.Final 之前及 4.2.16.Final 之前的版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44891","GHSA-vhch-2wf3-m8rp"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T21:17:06Z","updated":"2026-07-21T20:25:45Z","remediation":"升级 Netty 至 4.1.136.Final 或 4.2.16.Final 及以上版本，这两个版本已对 STOMP 帧的头部总数和累积大小施加限制。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对 STOMP 连接设置最大头部数量阈值，或通过反向代理限制单连接请求体大小作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/netty/netty/commit/5b68c61f37aa4a3045cba624cbea239655c9003b","https://github.com/netty/netty/commit/bb2ff68a1fb71cb4b0eb9a9e17b66c52aff680c6","https://github.com/netty/netty/pull/17063","https://github.com/netty/netty/pull/17065","https://github.com/netty/netty/releases/tag/netty-4.1.136.Final","https://github.com/netty/netty/releases/tag/netty-4.2.16.Final","https://github.com/netty/netty/security/advisories/GHSA-vhch-2wf3-m8rp","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-44891.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44891.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-44891.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/acd6946b811240fd9eb8b4695a0847eda8db127d/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-44891","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_3_CVE-2026-44891.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/maven/io.netty/netty-codec-stomp/CVE-2026-44891.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3e6800281dab3089a8374b9fe419c8b8110ea36/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44891.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/57037e9ca1e585082424bbd15c12a674807d0c21/content/posts/cve-2026-44891.md","https://github.com/oxsecurity/megalinter/blob/8a18f344792f20d1c2a7515315a80b5fa6191d7d/.trivyignore","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/d35b9b2c96d01b1b2393c4443fe48dfd8e9687ce/cve/CVE-2026-44891.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0271.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0536","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0536.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54465","title":"Faye websocket-driver HTTP 头部解析内存耗尽漏洞","description":"websocket-driver 是一个 WebSocket 协议处理库，当通过 `WebSocket::Driver.server()` 方法在 TCP 服务器上实现 WebSocket 服务或作为 WebSocket 客户端使用时，攻击者可通过发送包含无休止 HTTP 头部的请求或响应，导致单条连接消耗无上限的内存，最终使接收进程因内存耗尽而崩溃。该漏洞属于 CWE-770 资源无限制分配，影响所有使用 websocket-driver 0.8.1 之前版本的应用，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，但需要一定的网络条件。官方已在 0.8.1 版本中将 HTTP 请求/响应行及头部总大小限制为 32KB 以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54465","GHSA-8j3g-f24p-4mpw"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T20:17:26Z","updated":"2026-07-23T16:19:47Z","remediation":"立即将 websocket-driver Ruby gem 升级至 0.8.1 或更高版本，该版本将 HTTP 请求/响应行及头部总大小限制为 32KB，防止内存耗尽。如无法升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）设置 client_header_buffer_size 和 large_client_header_buffers 限制传入头部大小作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/faye/websocket-driver-ruby/commit/17b569f232896e71d458404ccf4854f80e987710","https://github.com/faye/websocket-driver-ruby/security/advisories/GHSA-8j3g-f24p-4mpw","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/6abafa39bbf76fbd32a01a93a3a2ba048c0f7143/gems/websocket-driver/CVE-2026-54465.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54465.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54465.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-54465","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/7fe93c0d9f67491f32ca61e33aaca423a4c19903/advisories/_posts/2026-06-04-CVE-2026-54465.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54465.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-54465.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54465.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/gem/websocket-driver/CVE-2026-54465.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54465.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0536.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0536.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0535","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0535.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54464","title":"Faye websocket-driver 消息压缩资源限制绕过漏洞","description":"websocket-driver 库在与 permessage-deflate 扩展配合使用时存在资源限制绕过漏洞。该库在检查 WebSocket 消息大小时仅校验压缩帧的长度头，而非解压后的实际数据大小，导致攻击者可通过发送精心构造的压缩消息绕过最大消息大小限制，使服务端或客户端接受超出预期大小的消息，从而耗尽系统资源（CPU/内存），造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用 websocket-driver 且启用 permessage-deflate 扩展的 Ruby 应用，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发。官方已在 0.8.1 版本中修复，在扩展处理完成后重新校验消息长度。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54464","GHSA-33ph-fccm-39pj"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T20:17:26Z","updated":"2026-07-23T18:14:09Z","remediation":"立即将 websocket-driver 升级至 0.8.1 或更高版本，该版本在扩展处理完成后检查消息长度以修复压缩绕过问题。如无法升级，可在应用层对 WebSocket 消息解压后的大小进行二次校验，拒绝超过配置最大值的消息。同时建议禁用 `permessage-deflate` 扩展作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/faye/websocket-driver-ruby/commit/fa8641724f10bf3273585f1dcf9041f540bbd036","https://github.com/faye/websocket-driver-ruby/security/advisories/GHSA-33ph-fccm-39pj","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/6abafa39bbf76fbd32a01a93a3a2ba048c0f7143/gems/websocket-driver/CVE-2026-54464.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54464.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54464.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-54464","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/7fe93c0d9f67491f32ca61e33aaca423a4c19903/advisories/_posts/2026-06-04-CVE-2026-54464.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54464.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-54464.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54464.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/gem/websocket-driver/CVE-2026-54464.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2b92b509a6091f543702b902d36eba35e2393da1/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54464.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0535.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0533","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0533.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54463","title":"Faye websocket-driver 协议长度头滥用导致内存耗尽漏洞","description":"websocket-driver 是一个 Ruby 语言实现的 WebSocket 协议处理器。在 0.8.1 版本之前，其使用的 WebSocket 协议草案版本中，帧格式的长度头部允许将任意大的整数编码为高位设置为 1 的字节序列。攻击者可以通过发送无限序列的 0x80 或更高字节值，使对端将这些字节解析为不断增长的整数。由于 Ruby 整数支持任意精度，这会导致 WebSocket 连接消耗无上限的内存，最终造成目标进程内存耗尽（OOM）。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程触发此漏洞，影响所有使用受影响版本 websocket-driver 的应用。该漏洞已在 0.8.1 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54463","GHSA-ghhp-3qvg-889p"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T20:17:26Z","updated":"2026-07-23T18:04:42Z","remediation":"立即将 websocket-driver Ruby gem 升级至 0.8.1 或更高版本，执行 `gem update websocket-driver` 或修改 Gemfile 指定 `gem 'websocket-driver', '>= 0.8.1'` 后运行 `bundle update websocket-driver`。该漏洞无已知临时缓解措施，必须通过升级修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/faye/websocket-driver-ruby/commit/d0141f041f6e3677a951255d547a313e732ccbe0","https://github.com/faye/websocket-driver-ruby/security/advisories/GHSA-ghhp-3qvg-889p","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/6abafa39bbf76fbd32a01a93a3a2ba048c0f7143/gems/websocket-driver/CVE-2026-54463.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54463.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54463.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-54463","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/7fe93c0d9f67491f32ca61e33aaca423a4c19903/advisories/_posts/2026-06-04-CVE-2026-54463.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-54463.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-54463.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54463.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/gem/websocket-driver/CVE-2026-54463.yml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-ghhp-3qvg-889p/GHSA-ghhp-3qvg-889p.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0533.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0495","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0495.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54171","title":"Excon HTTP 库重定向敏感标头泄露漏洞","description":"Excon（Ruby 高性能 HTTP 1.1 客户端库）的 RedirectFollower 重定向跟随中间件存在敏感信息泄露漏洞（CWE-201）。当初始 HTTP 请求中包含 Authorization、Cookie 等敏感头部信息时，中间件在跟随重定向跳转到第三方目标服务器时未能正确剥离这些敏感头部，导致敏感凭据可能被泄露给非预期的第三方。攻击者可通过构造恶意的重定向响应，诱使使用 Excon 的客户端应用泄露其请求中的敏感头部数据。该漏洞影响 Excon 1.5.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危，攻击复杂度低，无需认证，但需要用户交互。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54171","GHSA-48rx-c7pg-q66r"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T20:17:26Z","updated":"2026-07-23T16:16:59Z","remediation":"立即将 excon 升级至 v1.5.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 RedirectFollower 中间件未剥离敏感请求头的问题。如无法升级，可参考 commit ea89a353 将修复逻辑反向移植到自定义重定向跟随中间件中，手动添加需剥离的敏感头列表。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/excon/excon/commit/ea89a35308a12f4b791b6c50f2cbd33f94889fa3","https://github.com/excon/excon/pull/901","https://github.com/excon/excon/security/advisories/GHSA-48rx-c7pg-q66r","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/6abafa39bbf76fbd32a01a93a3a2ba048c0f7143/gems/excon/CVE-2026-54171.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54171.json","https://github.com/mapbox/mapbox-maps-ios/blob/ad6669ccf5a7baa56db9a579dcd3031fa671f34a/Gemfile","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-54171.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-54171","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/7fe93c0d9f67491f32ca61e33aaca423a4c19903/advisories/_posts/2026-06-03-CVE-2026-54171.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54171.json","https://github.com/mullvad/mullvadvpn-app/blob/cb35e5b1245e8b62a3c20f61fc23c4030c1b7f60/ios/osv-scanner.toml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-54171.md","https://github.com/Katsiarynakavaleuskaya/PulsePlate/blob/fde6e839c2b865eb0b8638cd5296e76cbd8f44d3/docs/security/CVE-2026-54171-excon-fastlane.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0495.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0352","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0352.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50289","title":"systeminformation systeminformation OS 命令注入漏洞","description":"systeminformation 库的 networkInterfaces() 函数在 Linux 上存在操作系统命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。漏洞根因在于 lib/network.js 的 checkLinuxDCHPInterfaces() 函数在解析 Debian/Ubuntu interfaces(5) 配置文件时，读取 /etc/network/interfaces 及其递归 source 指令引用的文件，将解析出的 source 路径直接未加引号地插入到 shell 命令字符串 `cat ${file} 2> /dev/null | grep 'iface\\\\|source'` 中，并通过 execSync() 经 /bin/sh 执行。攻击者若能控制 source 指令中的路径字符串（如写入包含 `;id>/tmp/PWNED;` 等 shell 元字符的路径），即可在调用 networkInterfaces() 的 Node.js 进程权限下执行任意命令。该函数被 networkInterfaces()、getStaticData()、getAllData() 等核心 API 间接调用，影响 systeminformation@5.31.7 之前版本，波及使用该库的资产清点、监控诊断、管理面板后端、设备管理代理等大量 Node.js 应用。攻击前置条件为攻击者能写入或影响被 source 递归引用的 interfaces 配置片段文件（如 /etc/network/interfaces.d/ 下的文件），无需 NetworkManager 或特殊硬件。利用方式为构造恶意 source 路径触发命令注入，PoC 验证显示可成功执行 id 命令并写入标记文件。CVSS 4.0 评分 8.7（HIGH），已在 5.31.7 版本修复，建议升级至该版本或更高版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50289","GHSA-5xpp-75jx-m839"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-17T20:17:24Z","updated":"2026-07-20T17:17:14Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 systeminformation 包到 5.31.7 或更高版本（npm install systeminformation@latest）。升级后该库将使用 fs.readFileSync 直接读取 /etc/network/interfaces 文件内容并通过 JS 逻辑解析，彻底移除 execSync 拼接 shell 命令的方式，从而彻底修复 OS 命令注入漏洞。如无法立即升级，可临时在应用层避免在 Linux 环境下调用 networkInterfaces()、getStaticData()、getAllData() 等会触及 networkInterfaces() 的 API，或在应用启动前确保 /etc/network/interfaces 及其 source 引用的文件不可被低权限用户写入（如 chmod 644 并限制写入权限）作为临时缓解。建议优先升级至 5.31.7+ 版本彻底修复。建议执行：npm audit fix --force 或 npm install systeminformation@5.31.7 完成升级。升级后建议运行现有测试用例验证网络接口信息采集功能正常。升级前建议备份 node_modules 并做回滚预案。升级后请重启所有依赖 systeminformation 的 Node.js 进程使新版本生效。如使用 Docker 部署，请重新构建镜像并拉取最新依赖。请参考官方修复提交：https://github.com/sebhildebrandt/systeminformation/commit/bbfddde48672d0ee124fefdb3cb4442fd9dd4f03","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/sebhildebrandt/systeminformation/commit/bbfddde48672d0ee124fefdb3cb4442fd9dd4f03","https://github.com/sebhildebrandt/systeminformation/releases/tag/v5.31.7","https://github.com/sebhildebrandt/systeminformation/security/advisories/GHSA-5xpp-75jx-m839","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f02fdda2bd389f5492ddcbf2ad808b3b60f20645/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50289.json","https://github.com/giselles-ai/giselle/blob/4b497a5d3aff88100301329938f2f97db1b4a234/.continuity/20260717-000000-agent__fix-systeminformation-cve-2026-50289.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-17/TIER_2_CVE-2026-50289.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-50289","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/systeminformation/CVE-2026-50289.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/48383ebc821dc38e09ecfcea6060abac8038780f/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50289.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/c6a7b446809d20910acd284474596c0b638aab06/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-50289/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/76fdd7fe4cd9d55f9aa8c105cb90aa42e34c98b9/content/posts/cve-2026-50289.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2026-50289.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/9d5a7d1c566e3b3d2231325259c035dd0347ef0d/posts/cve-2026-50289-npm-systeminformation.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0352.toml"}]